  "goodToKnow": "Die Umlage is a levy or charge spread among many payers. Landlords can pass on certain costs to tenants as Nebenkosten via an Umlage: die Kosten auf die Mieter umlegen. The EEG-Umlage, a surcharge on electricity bills that funded renewable energy, was abolished in July 2022 and is now paid from the federal budget. Umlegen means to apportion. Plural: die Umlagen."
